From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Towfienes <ngolamtien1706@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:56:10 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] hyprvx: world offsets in hit-testing, surface-local
 coordinates, warps, constraints and popups

Patch 0011 of the HyprVX V3 series (Feature 002, T022).

Every seam of research R8 takes the pointer in the owner window's L space
(the world point minus O(w)): windowAt, windowSurfaceAt and
surfaceLocalAt; the mouseMoveUnified surface fallback and cursor-shape
check; sendMotionEventsToFocused; pointer constraints and locks; warps
(warpCursor, updateRelativeCursorCoords); decoration and border hit
selection; the off-window axis warp; and the popup unconstrain box.
---
 src/config/shared/actions/ConfigActions.cpp |  8 ++---
 src/desktop/state/ViewHitTester.cpp         | 23 ++++++++------
 src/desktop/view/Popup.cpp                  | 11 +++++--
 src/desktop/view/Window.cpp                 |  9 ++++--
 src/managers/input/InputManager.cpp         | 34 +++++++++++++--------
 5 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

